  "description": {
   "extraction_status": "extracted",
   "value": "The study assessed whole-brain gray-matter morphology in patients with frontotemporal dementia and healthy controls using high-resolution MRI and voxel-based morphometry to test whether the rostral limbic system is selectively affected.",
